{"id":28698,"slug":"day-for-night","title":"Day for Night","year":1973,"country":"France","duration":116,"spine":769,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28698-day-for-night","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/7667c4229e57db415f4b05c81d07da43/AnZ260N6qfjN3t5vWZvfLYZv2PcaoB_large.jpg","description":"This affectionate farce from François Truffaut about the joys and strife of moviemaking is one of his most beloved films. Truffaut himself appears as the harried director of a frivolous melodrama, the shooting of which is plagued by the whims of a neurotic actor (Jean-Pierre Léaud), an aging but still forceful Italian diva (Valentina Cortese), and a British ingenue haunted by personal scandal (Jacqueline Bisset). An irreverent paean to the prosaic craft of cinema as well as a delightful human comedy about the pitfalls of sex and romance, Day for Night is buoyed by robust performances and a sparkling score by the legendary Georges Delerue.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"François Truffaut","slug":"francois-truffaut"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jacqueline Bisset","role":"Julie Baker","slug":"jacqueline-bisset"},{"actor":"Valentina Cortese","role":"Séverine","slug":"valentina-cortese"},{"actor":"Dani","role":"Liliane","slug":"dani"},{"actor":"Alexandra Stewart","role":"Stacey","slug":"alexandra-stewart"},{"actor":"Jean-Pierre Aumont","role":"Alexandre","slug":"jean-pierre-aumont"},{"actor":"Jean Champion","role":"Bertrand","slug":"jean-champion"},{"actor":"Jean-Pierre Léaud","role":"Alphonse","slug":"jean-pierre-leaud"},{"actor":"François Truffaut","role":"Ferrand","slug":"francois-truffaut"},{"actor":"Nike Arrighi","role":"Odile","slug":"nike-arrighi"},{"actor":"Nathalie Baye","role":"Joëlle","slug":"nathalie-baye"},{"actor":"Maurice Seveno","role":"Television reporter","slug":"maurice-seveno"},{"actor":"David Markham","role":"Dr. Nelson","slug":"david-markham"},{"actor":"Bernard Menez","role":"Bernard","slug":"bernard-menez"},{"actor":"Gas